# Open VSX Personal Access Token (PAT)
# 1. Sign in to https://open-vsx.org/ using GitHub.
# 2. Complete the Eclipse Foundation Publisher Agreement in settings.
# 3. Create namespace 'myside' matching the package.json publisher field.
# 4. Generate a Token on https://open-vsx.org/user-settings/tokens
OVSX_PAT=your_open_vsx_token_here
